SHEYTAN Music Visualizer — portable package marker.

The presence of this file beside the application executable selects
PORTABLE data mode: every mutable file (configuration, logs, cache,
projects, exports, temp files, crash diagnostics) is stored under the
data/ directory in THIS folder, never in hidden system locations.

Delete this file to make an installation use the per-user data
location instead (Windows: %LOCALAPPDATA%\SHEYTAN Music Visualizer;
Linux: $XDG_DATA_HOME/SHEYTAN Music Visualizer).
